1
00:00:03,203 --> 00:00:07,909
Open Interaction Center, Management, Opportunity Stages.

2
00:00:07,909 --> 00:00:12,993
A stage has a name, an order and a probability from 0 to 100.

3
00:00:13,446 --> 00:00:18,030
Closed says the opportunity is finished, and Won says it was a success.

4
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:20,769
A stage can only be won if it is closed.

5
00:00:20,769 --> 00:00:23,746
The probability feeds the weighted pipeline.

6
00:00:24,198 --> 00:00:29,685
Click Add Stage, enter the name, the order and the probability, and click Save.

7
00:00:29,685 --> 00:00:33,558
A new opportunity starts with its stage's probability.

